```javascript
setInterval(function() {
    location.reload();
}, 120000); // 120000 milliseconds = 2 minutes
```

Just hit `Enter`, and your page will reload every 2 minutes like a charm! If you want to stop it, simply run `clearInterval(intervalId)` where `intervalId` is the ID returned by `setInterval`. Ready to test it out? Go ahead and paste it in! 🚀

